  "description": "An ordinary office worker, Manager Oh, falls into the Demon Realm instead of making it to work. When he wakes up, he has become thDestined to become the youngest manager in company history, Hyeonmin Oh is the perfect manager who makes the impossible happen. Until one night, after three months of working overtime, he finally passes out on the subway. When he opens his eyes... He’s somehow become the lord of the Demon Realm?! To survive, he has to lead the goblins to victory in a Territory War. But if there’s one thing Hyeonmin knows how to do, it’s turn a failing operation around. Can the ultimate corporate workhorse turn a bunch of goblins into a successful company? Looks like everyone's working overtime tonight!\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
